---
/**
 * PrivoLabs — Quality Engineering Service Page
 * Source: 03-CONTENT.md §5.5
 */

import Page from '../../layouts/Page.astro';
---

<Page 
  title="Quality Engineering | PrivoLabs" 
  description="The work that makes the other work hold. Automated testing, performance, security, and AI-specific QA."
>
  <section class="hero-section container">
    <div class="hero-content">
      <p class="eyebrow">Service</p>
      <h1 class="font-display heading hero-heading">The work that makes the other work hold</h1>
      <p class="font-body text-large hero-subhead">
        Testing isn't a phase at the end. It's the thing that lets you deploy on a Friday.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="capabilities-section container bg-surface-alt">
    <div class="section-header">
      <p class="eyebrow">Overview</p>
      <h2 class="font-display heading">Quality & Automation</h2>
    </div>
    
    <div class="grid gap-grid mt-8">
      <div class="panel">
        <h3 class="label">Capabilities</h3>
        <ul class="bullet-list font-body mt-4">
          <li>Automated suites in Jest, Selenium, and Cypress</li>
          <li>Performance and load testing</li>
          <li>Security validation, penetration testing, and vulnerability scanning</li>
          <li>CI/CD pipeline design</li>
          <li>Compliance verification</li>
          <li>Continuous monitoring</li>
          <li>User behaviour analytics</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="panel">
        <h3 class="label">AI-specific QA</h3>
        <p class="font-body mt-4">
          Evaluation harnesses for non-deterministic systems, regression detection when providers change models, and adversarial testing for prompt injection. Almost nobody offers this, and every AI buyer eventually needs it.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="cta-section container bg-brand text-inverse">
    <h2 class="font-display heading">Tell us what you're building.</h2>
    <p class="font-body text-large">Send the problem, not a spec. First conversation is with an engineer, not a salesperson, and you'll get a straight answer about whether we're the right fit.</p>
    <a href="/contact" class="btn btn-inverse mt-6">Start a project</a>
  </section>
</Page>

<style>
  section {
    padding-top: var(--s-12);
    padding-bottom: var(--s-12);
  }

  .hero-section {
    padding-top: var(--s-14);
  }

  .section-header {
    margin-bottom: var(--s-8);
  }

  .hero-heading {
    font-size: clamp(3rem, 6vw, 4.5rem);
    line-height: 1.1;
    margin: var(--s-4) 0 var(--s-6);
    max-width: 900px;
  }

  .hero-subhead {
    max-width: 720px;
    margin-bottom: var(--s-8);
    color: var(--text-muted);
  }

  .grid {
    display: grid;
    gap: var(--s-8);
  }

  .gap-grid {
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(300px, 1fr));
  }
  
  .bullet-list {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--s-2);
    list-style: disc;
    padding-left: var(--s-4);
  }

  .cta-section {
    padding: var(--s-14) var(--s-6);
    border-radius: var(--r-lg);
    margin-bottom: var(--s-12);
    text-align: center;
    background-color: var(--brand-600);
    color: white;
  }

  .cta-section p {
    max-width: 600px;
    margin: var(--s-4) auto 0;
    opacity: 0.9;
  }

  .btn {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    padding: 0 var(--s-6);
    height: 48px;
    border-radius: var(--r-md);
    font-weight: 500;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: all var(--t-fast) var(--ease-out);
  }

  .btn-inverse {
    background: white;
    color: var(--brand-600);
  }

  .btn-inverse:hover {
    background: var(--surface-alt);
  }

  .bg-surface-alt {
    background-color: var(--surface-alt);
    border-radius: var(--r-lg);
    padding: var(--s-8) var(--s-6);
    margin: var(--s-8) 0;
  }

  .mt-4 { margin-top: var(--s-4); }
  .mt-6 { margin-top: var(--s-6); }
  .mt-8 { margin-top: var(--s-8); }
</style>
